.playwright-mcp/

# Markdown is not published to the remote. Project documentation lives in
# README.rst; design notes, plans and specs stay local to the working copy.
*.md

# ...and the same file named the other way round. `.env.*` anchors on the
# leading dot, so a `<name>.env` file slips past it — `.prod.env` did, and was
# one `git add -A` away from being committed.
*.env
!.env.example
